   "status": "MISMATCH",
   "ruling": "Ruling: scope; i1040sca p. 2, Line 1: \"Any person you could have claimed as a dependent except that you or your spouse if filing jointly can be claimed as a dependent on someone else's 2025 return.\" As the prior ruling: the restatement leaves that person out because the case cannot reach line 1: a filer who, or whose joint spouse, can be claimed as a dependent is refused by sa.dependent (\"Can someone claim you or your spouse as a dependent for 2025, or are you a dual-status alien?\"), on the deduction line Form 1040 line 12e reads, so no completed return has that person's expenses to enter (PENDING-4 of the ptc-sa package). The R4 restructuring moved the people into a list without adding or removing one; nothing else in the restatement is objected to.",
   "subject_key": "7f83d84ba9e0a9d1407bbaa86888b7b06c0c0a37a57e602ea30a187c02cbba6e"
